<title>GERMANY: Lufthansa Jan-Oct pax load factor 70.9pct.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa Jan-Oct pax load factor 70.9pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Lufthansa AG saw its January-October group passenger load factor drop to 70.9 percent, down 0.7 percentage points on the same period last year, the airline's investor relations department said in its latest monthly report.</p>
<p>The following table shows traffic for January-October 1996.</p>
<p>Total passengers (group) (million)  35.3  up 1.6 pct</p>
<p>Available seat kilometres (million) 97.48 up 3.2 pct</p>
<p>    Revenue seat kilometres (million)   69.10 up 2.2 pct</p>
<p>    Passenger load factor	     70.9  down 0.7 pct points</p>
<p>--Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
